\title{Multi-Mode Pinching-Antenna Systems: An Inter-Mode-Interference-Free Perspective}
\author{Jingjing Zhao, Songtao Xue, Xidong Mu, Kaiquan Cai, and Zhiguo Ding,~\IEEEmembership{Fellow,~IEEE}
\thanks{J. Zhao, S. Xue and K. Cai are with the School of Electronics and Information Engineering, Beihang University, Beijing, 100191, China, and also with the State Key Laboratory of CNS/ATM, Beijing, 100191, China (e-mail:\{jingjingzhao, xuesongtao, caikq\}@buaa.edu.cn). X. Mu is with the Centre for Wireless Innovation (CWI), Queen's University Belfast, Belfast, BT3 9DT, U.K (e-mail: x.mu@qub.ac.uk). Z. Ding  is with the School of Electrical and Electronic Engineering, Nanyang Technological University, 639798, Singapore (e-mail:
