e^{-j\left(\beta_{\text{p}}-\beta_{m}\right)\xi_{1}}
e^{-j\left(\beta_{m'}-\beta_{\text{p}}\right)\xi_{2}}\mathrm{d}\xi_{2}\,\mathrm{d}\xi_{1}}_{\text{amplitude transfer coefficient of path } m'\rightarrow \text{PA}\rightarrow m}.
