The IMI observed at mode $m$ contains the direct leakage from other guided modes $m'\neq m$, as well as the corresponding PA-mediated and non-PA-mediated higher-order transition components. 
First consider the direct signal leakage from guided mode $m'$ to $m$. Evaluating the integral in Eq.~\eqref{eq:m-n-direct-transition} yields
\begin{equation}
