Four metrics are reported, namely the net sum-SE of \eqref{eq:net_se} averaged over frames, the raw sum-SE $R_{\mathrm{sum}}$ that separates the airtime cost from the beam-selection quality, the $5$th percentile of the per-UE net rate, and the system OP, i.e. the empirical fraction of frames in which at least one scheduled UE falls below the target SINR,
