\label{eq:outage_def}
\end{equation}
where $N_{\mathrm{f}}$ is the number of simulated frames and the threshold is converted to the linear scale before use, i.e. $\gamma_{\mathrm{th}}=10^{1/10}=1.259$, which corresponds to a per-UE SE threshold of $\log_2(1+\gamma_{\mathrm{th}})=1.176$~bps/Hz.}
